WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.520
It's...

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.070
It's...

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.350
The unfolding of the fifth dimension...

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.260
The unfolding of the sixth dimension...

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.870
The unfolding of the seventh dimension...

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.040
This can't be happening!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.250
No way!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:42.400
I never thought the Philosopher's Stone 
would go out of control in this way...

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.910
This is going out of control?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.730
I thought I was just going 
to die, and that was it!

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.770
What is that?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.270
Please, God...

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.210
Montmorency!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.600
What's happening?

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.620
What was that hole?

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.790
What's that beast?

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:19.400
La Hire, take Jeanne and Astaroth, 
and run from this place, now!

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.570
What?

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.090
What about you?

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.110
Hurry!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:48.290
<b>#10 Beast of the Apocalypse</b>

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.530
Jeanne d'Arc and the Alchemist Knight

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.460
Mur d'Air!

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.710
This is...

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.480
You monster!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:43.950
I don't know what you are, 
but go back to where you came from!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.000
Retreat, full speed!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.120
Don't stop!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.720
The Hole of Babylon...

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:26.890
<i>I never thought it would go 
out of control in this way...</i>

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:29.480
<i>In the worst way imaginable!</i>

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.570
This is...

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.820
What is this sight?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.680
I'm the King of Gods!

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.040
A mere human like you intends 
to seal me in the Void Dimension?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.040
Astaroth?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.800
We're the ones who created human beings!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.670
What you're trying to do is 
the mortal sin of murdering gods!

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.300
A parricide!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.470
Human beings without their masters

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.600
will recklessly set free 
their desires and ambitions,

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.990
and will fight one another for eternity!

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:43.120
Peace was maintained in this 
world because we ruled over you!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:47.880
You will lose your utopia for all eternity!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.260
We will definitely return!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:56.280
I promise you!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.410
This is goodbye.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.380
You're going to die now?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:22.560
Leaving me alone in this world without gods?

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:25.940
Not all of the gods have vanished.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.490
There's still a goddess.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:33.160
You, who will bless us human beings.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.710
The future of the utopia...

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.690
rests in your hands...

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.480
D-Demon!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.920
Fire!

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.660
I have obtained it...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.170
The Philosopher's Stone that sealed me...

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.690
is mine!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.110
There's nothing to fear now!

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.990
Respond to my voice, Ship in the Sky!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.520
The Hole of Babylon has opened,

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.270
and it is under my control.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.490
Let's start a utopia,

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:45.120
that wonderful utopia, once again!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:49.120
But first, I have to cleanse the humans.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.010
Just as it was predicted.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.210
You're...

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:04.190
I should've taken his life on that day.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.630
But I wanted to believe...

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.760
that people are not slaves of their fate...

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.780
That love would change his destiny.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.330
Explain it so that we will understand!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.280
What happened to Montmorency?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.070
What was the monster 
that came out of the sky?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.730
What's happening now?

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.970
At least tell us what we can do.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.300
Then we'll...

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.670
There's nothing to be done.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.050
He's our last hope.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.300
Who are you, old man?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.260
Nicolas Flamel,

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:46.910
from the organization formed to create human's 
utopia, made by humans, for humans...

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:48.520
The Temple Knights.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.610
I am the last surviving member.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:56.110
Astaroth!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.770
Astaroth!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.570
Astaroth!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.800
Hurry, to the fortress!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.330
Astaroth!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.880
Is Astaroth going to be okay?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.730
There was nothing we could do.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.040
Let's head to Augustine's Fortress for now.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.890
We can hide in the fortress,

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.830
but the same thing will happen
 to it as the Tourelles complex!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:26.030
I wanted to at least die looking like a boy.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.020
I wanted to die wearing boy's underwear!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.490
God, please let me go to heaven!

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.360
Don't pray to gods!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:38.230
We must defeat one of those gods.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:50.520
We, the Temple Knights, fought 
towards the east for one reason only.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:54.460
To destroy the Philosopher's 
Stones that rested there.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:00.540
But a traitor brought one 
of them back to France,

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:05.140
and the stone ended up 
in Montmorency's hands.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.360
Astaroth, you sinner.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.260
I've dreamed for this day 
of revenge for thousands of years.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.540
Now that I think of it, 
perhaps everything was a curse.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.670
A curse of the gods who wanted to return 
to this world, no matter what it took.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.480
You're in my way, human.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:36.120
Move aside.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.170
I refuse.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.630
What?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.820
This is the realm of humans.

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:50.390
Gods, have a taste...

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:56.150
of the technique developed 
by humans, alchemy!

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:02.150
This world doesn't need 
the gods or Philosopher's Stones.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:09.090
The utopia must be built 
by people... human beings!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:15.610
Mere human tricks!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.980
I said, "Move aside!"

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.740
A utopia built by human beings?

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.370
What a joke.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.120
Astaroth, I told you.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.470
Human beings without their masters

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:52.840
will recklessly set free 
their desires and ambitions,

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:55.390
and will fight one another for eternity.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:59.030
And you will lose 
your utopia for all eternity!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.830
I was right.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:06.790
You can't kill me, the Guardian 
of Philosopher's Stones!

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:09.560
I can keep killing you.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:13.680
I'll keep killing you for eternity.

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:25.610
It quieted down.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:27.660
Let's go!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.800
Take care of Jeanne.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.530
Don't tell me...

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:41.740
You know what'll happen if you use 
the Philosopher's Stone without elixir!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:45.680
If I can restore Montmorency's 
sanity before the poison spreads,

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:46.590
and baiser with him...

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.980
That's not possible!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.140
Damn it! Let me borrow the Joyeuse!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.660
I'll become Ulysses...

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.280
Just wait, Jeanne.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:59.400
I'll get back your Montmorency.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.880
Wake up, Montmorency!

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:28.360
No!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:30.260
That's enough.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.510
La Hire! You...

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.260
Tell me, Astaroth.

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:40.630
What should I do to get back Montmorency?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:45.080
If you take the Philosopher's Stone 
out of his body...

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.160
Then...

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.680
The Hole of Babylon will close,

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:51.780
and the gods will be sealed... 
in the Void Dimension again...

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:54.410
You think it's possible?

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.540
You livestocks!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.080
What is that weapon?

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:13.850
Fast!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.260
Not only that, I can't read its course!

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:17.670
A magical bullet?

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:19.340
You're a magical bullet shooter?!

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:25.320
What a rotten world we live in, filled with war, 
conspiracy, murder and betrayal.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:30.570
But there's a girl who still chooses 
to live honestly in such a world.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:34.320
I can't make her cry!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.420
You may be a magical bullet shooter,

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:44.040
but you can't target these 
spears made of hardened air...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.520
invisible spears!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:53.160
I'll bite off your head after 
you're impaled on the ground!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.360
Die!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.780
Damn it!

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:11.610
Incredible... Maybe you can...

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.490
What?

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:20.420
It seems Joyeuse gives the ability 
of "accuracy" to its user.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.830
Whether or not I can see the target...

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.540
I'll never miss!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.250
I've reached the time limit?

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:42.520
It was only for a short while, 
but thank you for protecting me.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.030
You can have this.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.310
It's not over yet!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:03.850
You're... nothing... but trouble...

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.800
What?

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.540
No way...

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:30.300
Sorry for getting you involved...

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.070
La Hire.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.680
Montmorency...

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.990
Finish me off.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:52.000
Blast my head with that gun.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.510
Seal the gods that have 
no place in this world.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:00.170
I can't hold it for much longer.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:02.220
Please, kill me!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.600
H-How can I do that?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.580
You have to do it!

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:09.590
In exchange for Jeanne 
and everyone's future...

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.730
My life is a small price to pay!

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:27.200
Montmorency...

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.610
Stop, Montmorency!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:35.600
Please...

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:37.920
Someone, someone...

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.620
Kill me!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.140
What the hell?

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:54.800
I thought the rule was you couldn't 
become Ulysses twice in a same day.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.710
Yeah, that's what I thought, too.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.650
You have a problem with this?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.780
<i>Montmorency...</i>

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.160
<i>Montmorency...</i>

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.770
<i>Montmorency!</i>

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.230
"Kill me."

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.630
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.560
You fool!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:31.820
You promised to protect me!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:36.840
You promised to never let me 
be alone until the day I die!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.340
But what now?

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.810
Get ready!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:43.840
I'll beat you to your senses!

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:46.080
Enough of your babbling, human!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.110
I have no business with you!

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:52.330
Stay out of my way!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:20:00.420
You dare insult your god?!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.440
Montmorency! Look at me!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.940
Look at me!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:13.990
Jeanne?

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:20.070
No, I won't let it happen!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.690
I hereby declare...

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.630
judgment has been passed!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.290
She falsely assumed the title of a saint,

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.840
lied about her purity,

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:47.150
and the witch who conspired to throw 
France into darkness forever...

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.600
is no more!

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:53.320
I repeat.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:56.150
The witch is no more!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.110
Sheesh, this is a disturbing dream.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.140
It's just a dream.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.700
This can't possibly happen.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.180
But why do I know...

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.500
that this is the truth?

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:35.220
That this is something that will 
happen to Jeanne in the future?

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.540
Montmorency?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.950
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:34.930
<b>#11 Utopia, Then...</b>

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:22.480
Montmorency's heart is filled with darkness,

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:23.720
Jeanne's voice is not reaching him.

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:25.440
The powerful gods are descending!

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:27.290
I love the saying, bigger is better,

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:28.800
but this problem is too big to handle!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.760
Episode 11: "Utopia, Then..."

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:34.500
Maybe this isn't the time 
to be talking about boobs?!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Surprisingly useful French lesson</b>

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>"What a rotten world!"</b>

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Use it when you've lost hope in the world!</b>

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:41.930
<b></b>
